Package: danos-open
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         frr (>= 10.2),
         vpp (>= 24.06)
Description: Disaggregated Network Operating System (Open)
 DANOS-Open is a Software-First, ASIC-SDK-Free Disaggregated NOS
 built with Linux, FRR, VPP, DPDK, and P4.
 .
 This package contains:
  - danos-dpa: Data Plane Abstraction API library
  - danos-core: Core engine (object registry, state store, transactions)
  - danos-fib: FRR FIB adapter (ZAPI parser + mapper)
  - danos-vpp: VPP backend (capability + mapper)
  - danos-mgmt: Management plane (CLI + gNMI-like REST server)
  - danos-models: YANG models
  - danos-test: Conformance and unit tests

Package: danos-open-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: danos-open (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for DANOS-Open
 Header files and static libraries for DANOS-Open development.
